file: macros/src/conversions.rs
breaks: The enum gets `From<Payload>` for every variant not marked `from = false`, as `docs/what-is-generated.md` and `docs/options.md` say.
expect: survives
reason: No cell converts a payload into the enum or back, so the conversions are not modelled.

find:
        .filter(|(_, conversions)| conversions.from)
replace:
        .filter(|(_, conversions)| !conversions.from)
